OL,3,AEx-OpenAI worker accused of planting
OL,4,Adevice had Saudi support says court
OL,5,Afiling
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt was argued the 35-year-old engineer
OL,8,Ftherefore posed a flight risk and
OL,9,Fshould be detained, pending trial.
OL,11,FThe Saudi government did not
OL,12,Fimmediately respond to BBC requests for
OL,13,Fcomment.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
