OL,3,AKylie Jenner's debut at Victoria's
OL,4,ASecret Fashion Show in $50m bra sparks
OL,5,Amixed reaction
OL,6,
OL,7,FReality TV star Kylie Jenner has
OL,8,Fsparked mixed reaction after making her
OL,9,FVictoria's Secret Fashion Show debut in
OL,10,Fa $50m (#37m) bra.
OL,12,FThe make-up mogul surprised the crowd
OL,13,Fat the lingerie giant's annual show on
OL,14,FSunday while wearing the famed Fantasy
OL,15,FBra, which was made of 18-carat gold
OL,16,Fand 4,410 diamonds, according to the
OL,17,Fdesigner.
OL,19,FThe Fantasy Bra has been a key feature
OL,20,Fof the show over the years and wearing
OL,21,Fit is typically seen as an honour and
OL,22,Fdefining moment for the chosen model.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
